 aliases from the host SASE config in the chezmoi repo, keep [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`image`, and retune the `researchers` bucket description.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Harden the installed-swarm fan-out regression[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]fanout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after swarm[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fanout: make the fakey runner-slot test that plans the installed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]research swarm independent of machine-wide provider-disable state and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend it to cover the new opt-in providers.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-14t","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-14t.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-55233eaef55751b7fa620e7da0a49faf","started_at":"2026-09-21T00:57:23.633252+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"62f76b232c56405b25af6b4a535ed364bed7832796f58b2eed3349bd11e68d31","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14t.3/chat.md","size_bytes":1842},"commits":{"digest":"6dcc8cea684a39cf3853bf2bae2dc704b48622737cdd2483fb7795d381255fd5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14t.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14t.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"3531f1c17c83a9f1b6ad7a9f438d1202f1e7e4d98ed1c75232d6e19f60463772","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14t.3/meta.json","size_bytes":683},"prompt":{"digest":"dec544ca288ef3cc86574e4b1409c408265279de826c942e893ab550dc6ba2ac","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14t.3/prompt.md","size_bytes"